translate spanish bar_cyber1_2dc28ff9:

    # Fl "Oh, come now, Ember. He doesn’t exactly look like a child—not to most people, anyway."
    Fl "Vamos, Ember. No parece exactamente un niño; al menos no para la mayoría."

