translate spanish bar_cyber1_e34e1428:

    # mc "Pleased to meet you. My name is..."
    mc "Encantado de conocerte. Me llamo..."

# game/Story01.rpy:3744

translate spanish bar_cyber1_f49d322d:

    # em "And what urgent matter made you rush to meet me? Don’t tell me it’s because of that little bug sitting downstairs."
    em "¿Y qué asunto urgente te hizo venir corriendo a verme? No me digas que es por ese bichito de abajo."

# game/Story01.rpy:3749

translate spanish bar_cyber1_71e8ed36:

    # Fl "Ember, do be kind and show him a shred of respect. He might not look the part, but..."
    Fl "Ember, sé amable y muéstrale al menos una pizca de respeto. Puede que no lo parezca, pero..."

# game/Story01.rpy:3751

translate spanish bar_cyber1_719d8090:

    # em "You know perfectly well I couldn’t care less, don’t you? I decide how I address someone, thank you very much."
    em "Sabes perfectamente que me importa un comino, ¿verdad? Yo decido cómo dirigirme a alguien, muchas gracias."

# game/Story01.rpy:3753

translate spanish bar_cyber1_a67e690c:

    # em "Even if he were the High Chaplain himself or the head of the Federation, it wouldn’t make a jot of difference to me."
    em "Aunque fuera el mismísimo Alto Capellán o la cabeza de la Federación, no cambiaría absolutamente nada para mí."

# game/Story01.rpy:3756

translate spanish bar_cyber1_e479f401:

    # em "Now, let’s get to the point. Something serious must have happened if you’ve used your last favour to meet me. I dropped everything for this, so I trust it’s a compelling reason."
    em "Ahora, vayamos al grano. Algo serio tuvo que pasar si usaste tu último favor para verme. Dejé todo por esto, así que confío en que la razón sea convincente."

# game/Story01.rpy:3758

translate spanish bar_cyber1_562ac400:

    # Fl "As if mingling with pompous, self-important blowhards is a better alternative to spending time with me. Honestly, I’m offended."
    Fl "Como si codearte con fanfarrones pomposos y llenos de sí mismos fuera mejor alternativa que pasar tiempo conmigo. Francamente, me ofende."

# game/Story01.rpy:3760

translate spanish bar_cyber1_becd0b03:

    # em "At times, yes. You can be quite the thorn in my side."
    em "A veces, sí. Puedes ser una auténtica espina clavada."

# game/Story01.rpy:3762

translate spanish bar_cyber1_1fd80922:

    # Fl "Ouch. Wounded to my core. Truly."
    Fl "Ay. Herida hasta el alma. De verdad."

# game/Story01.rpy:3764

translate spanish bar_cyber1_37da8095:

    # em "Yes, yes, as you say. Enough theatrics. Out with it already before my curiosity gets the better of me."
    em "Sí, sí, lo que digas. Basta de teatro. Suéltalo antes de que mi curiosidad me pueda."

# game/Story01.rpy:3766

translate spanish bar_cyber1_1151d529:

    # Fl "Ah, so now you’re curious? Well, too bad. I’ve lost all interest in discussing it."
    Fl "Ah, ¿ahora tienes curiosidad? Qué lástima. Se me fueron todas las ganas de hablar del tema."

# game/Story01.rpy:3768

translate spanish bar_cyber1_860a9535:

    # em "I swear by the Nine Apostles, if you don’t tell me right this instant, I’ll throw you out of here."
    em "Juro por los Nueve Apóstoles que, si no me lo dices ahora mismo, te echaré de aquí."

# game/Story01.rpy:3770

translate spanish bar_cyber1_1c3ddaba:

    # Fl "The Ark’s been found."
    Fl "El Arca ha sido encontrada."

# game/Story01.rpy:3772

translate spanish bar_cyber1_422af95a:

    # em "WHAT?! WHO?! WHEN?! BY WHOM?!"
    em "¿QUÉ?! ¿QUIÉN?! ¿CUÁNDO?! ¿POR QUIÉN?!"

# game/Story01.rpy:3774

translate spanish bar_cyber1_2e7897ec:

    # Fl "And he’s sitting right in front of you."
    Fl "Y está sentado justo delante de ti."

# game/Story01.rpy:3776

translate spanish bar_cyber1_a7cb1c9c:

    # em "A piece of cake, you mean to say this... wretch was inside the Ark? I don’t believe it."
    em "Un momento, ¿quieres decir que este... despojo estaba dentro del Arca? No lo creo."

# game/Story01.rpy:3778

translate spanish bar_cyber1_0117a7a1:

    # Fl "No, he’s not part of the Inquisition."
    Fl "No, no es parte de la Inquisición."

