    mc "¿A dónde?"

# game/Story01.rpy:4465

translate spanish path_first_left_next_5_2e883b7f:

    # Fl "Looks like the path ahead is blocked. Your best bet is to take a right at the junction up ahead."
    Fl "Parece que el camino de delante está bloqueado. Lo mejor será girar a la derecha en el cruce."

# game/Story01.rpy:4466

translate spanish path_first_left_next_5_4d6deed5:

    # Fl "But, uh… I don’t like what I’m seeing there."
    Fl "Pero... no me gusta lo que veo ahí."

# game/Story01.rpy:4478

translate spanish path_first_left_next_5_1129d10e:

    # mc "Another poor soul... and his head’s been torn clean off. What on earth happened here?"
    mc "Otra pobre alma... y le arrancaron la cabeza de cuajo. ¿Qué demonios pasó aquí?"

# game/Story01.rpy:4480

translate spanish path_first_left_next_5_d83e5987:

    # Fl "Seems like someone tried to put up a fight. But judging by the show? Their defense failed—either they were outgunned, or there just weren’t enough of them to hold the line"
    Fl "Parece que alguien intentó resistir. Pero, a juzgar por la escena, su defensa falló: o les superaban en armas, o no eran suficientes para mantener la línea."

# game/Story01.rpy:4482

translate spanish path_first_left_next_5_21e97c10:

    # Fl "One thing’s odd, though: all the wounds are identical. Every single one."
    Fl "Aunque hay algo raro: todas las heridas son idénticas. Todas."

# game/Story01.rpy:4484

translate spanish path_first_left_next_5_d9892d8c:

    # mc "You noticed that too? Do you have any idea who—or what—might have done this?"
    mc "¿Tienes idea de quién, o qué, pudo hacer esto?"

# game/Story01.rpy:4489

translate spanish path_first_left_next_5_18bf3012:

    # Fl "My guess? The handiwork of that creature you dealt with earlier."
    Fl "¿Mi apuesta? La obra de esa criatura con la que te enfrentaste antes."

# game/Story01.rpy:4491

translate spanish path_first_left_next_5_f37fa3a7:

    # mc "Are you suggesting it was responsible for all of this carnage?"
    mc "¿Sugieres que fue responsable de toda esta carnicería?"

# game/Story01.rpy:4493

translate spanish path_first_left_next_5_3344fa86:

    # Fl "Yes, it’s all its doing. It made certain these poor souls didn’t leave here alive."
    Fl "Sí, todo esto es cosa suya. Se aseguró de que estas pobres almas no salieran vivas de aquí."

# game/Story01.rpy:4494

translate spanish path_first_left_next_5_b985ae99:

    # mc "Good thing it’s no longer a problem, then."
    mc "Menos mal que ya no es un problema, entonces."

# game/Story01.rpy:4496

translate spanish path_first_left_next_5_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# game/Story01.rpy:4501

translate spanish path_first_left_next_5_bb25408c:

    # Fl "Or… there’s another possibility. The pattern of these injuries? It’s eerily similar to something else. I hope I’m wrong, but…"
    Fl "O... hay otra posibilidad. El patrón de estas heridas se parece de forma inquietante a otra cosa. Espero equivocarme, pero..."

