# game/Story01.rpy:1384

translate spanish firstanswer_043e8147:

    # h "The Astral Dominion — ruthless conquerors who use dragons as weapons. They turn entire worlds into blood factories to fuel their magic."
    h "El Dominio Astral: conquistadores despiadados que usan dragones como armas. Convierten mundos enteros en fábricas de sangre para alimentar su magia."

# game/Story01.rpy:1385

