    # mc "How did you find us? We went a completely different way."
    mc "¿Cómo nos encontraste? Fuimos por una ruta completamente distinta."

# game/Story01.rpy:7797

translate spanish final2_44bdeb62:

    # o "We were following the Inquisitor. At first, everything was going fine. But then — suddenly — we changed course."
    o "Íbamos siguiendo a la inquisidora. Al principio todo iba bien. Pero entonces, de pronto, cambiamos de rumbo."

# game/Story01.rpy:7798

translate spanish final2_0bd87b94:

    # o "That’s when we stumbled across this complex."
    o "Así fue como dimos con este complejo."

